---
description: Best practices for using Storybook in component development
globs: **/*.stories.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}
alwaysApply: false
---
- Create stories for all components to showcase different states and props.
- Use Storybook addons like a11y for accessibility testing and controls for interactive props.
- Implement chromatic integration for visual regression testing.
- Organize stories in a hierarchical structure that mirrors your component library.